FROM dhi.io/node:24.22.1-dev@sha256:20cf36e12660c68b1e28887d1e71a7f2494bcea9d034709368e0afce77728eb0 AS builder
WORKDIR /usr/app

# Webserver, Debugger
EXPOSE 80 9229

ENTRYPOINT ["npx", "nodemon", "-e", "js,json,yml", "--watch", "./dist", "--watch", "./config", "--inspect=0.0.0.0:9229", "--nolazy", "./dist/index.js", "start"]
